Package: gghoneycomb
Title: Honeycomb Plots for ggplot2
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Devin R", "Leopold", email = "devin.leopold@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides geoms and stats for creating honeycomb-style hexagonal
    grid visualizations as an extension to ggplot2. Enables the display of
    categorical or continuous data in a compact, visually appealing hexagonal
    layout.
